{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And he served him.</b> With cleanliness and with zeal." "<b>And he appointed him over his house.</b> He appointed him over the household, in the manner of what is written (I Kings 18:3): ״ויקרא אחאב אל עבדיהו אשר על הבית״." "<b>And all that he has he given into his hand.</b> He appointed him chief of the treasury, in the manner of what is written (Isaiah 22:15): ״לך בא אל הסוכן הזה על שבנא אשר על הבית״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:18:44.610610941Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}